<tr><td><span class="badge high">high</span></td>
<td>nsg-app: rule allow-ssh allows Internet -> port 22</td><td>security</td><td><code>nsg_open_to_internet</code></td>
<td><code>/subscriptions/sub-prod/resourcegroups/rg-network/providers/microsoft.network/networksecuritygroups/nsg-app</code></td></tr>
