<td>stprodapp01 allows public blob access</td><td>security</td><td><code>storage_public_blob_access</code></td>
<td><code>/subscriptions/sub-prod/resourcegroups/rg-app/providers/microsoft.storage/storageaccounts/stprodapp01</code></td></tr>
