<td>web-dev does not enforce HTTPS-only traffic</td><td>security</td><td><code>web_app_https_only_disabled</code></td>
<td><code>/subscriptions/sub-dev/resourcegroups/rg-dev/providers/microsoft.web/sites/web-dev</code></td></tr>
